          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1792950744125,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        },
        "notes": "2026-10-26 audit: of the dialog, the contract covers name, description, edge routing and layout mode. Not in the contract: layout settings (auto-place imports, default layout, flow direction, lane gap, serpentine, cycle fallback, ELK algorithm, routing, port constraints, spacing, curvature bias), and project metadata (tags, milestones, share link, GitHub), which is not authoring. Decide: add the layout settings as graph switches, or leave them as app tooling. DECIDED 2026-10-26: the layout settings are graph switches (11 added: default layout, direction, lane gap, serpentine, cycle fallback, five ELK options and curve bias)."
      }
