        },
        "notes": "2026-10-26: first version built, not yet seen in the editor: utils/contractFields.js (pure, 4 tests), components/ContractFields.js, and a Presentation section on the node panel showing the switches for the selected kind that have no hand-built control. Next: look at it in the editor, then retire hand-built controls one at a time by letting the generated field take over (flip includeBuilt per switch). 2026-10-26: Visible retired from Behavior (drawn from the contract). Decided: semanticZoom.resolution and renderShape stay as they are. They are set by resizing the node and by other tooling, not by this panel, so they are not replaced by generated fields and the declared-fields table in GraphEditorContent.js stays."
      }
