        "owner": "Michael",
        "status": "answered",
        "body": "Each gets its own panel, built from the same contract, with a scope value each. The graph panel would be the one with none today.\n\nDecision: Keep four authoring scopes: node, edge, handle, graph. These are distinct editing responsibilities, not necessarily four unrelated object kinds. Generate the appropriate panel from the shared authoring contract.",
