        "body": "Only the preset styles (Preset style: default, highlight, calm) are in question: they have hung around since early on and are unused, so as they stand they are noise. Rehash them into something worth using, or remove them. Needs a design, then Michael's say, before either. The rest of the appearance section (background, text and border colour, border width, corner radius, fonts) stays; it may need review but is not trash, and it is still not in the contract, so reviewing it and describing its fields as node switches is a separate step.",
